## Cursor Task routing (explicit invocation only)

This managed rule is generated from `packages/task/configs/command-routing.json`.
Apply only when the owner explicitly invokes Task or attaches this manual rule.
Ordinary requests and existing plan files do not activate Task.

- Fixed economy commands: none.
- Fixed implementation commands: `task:dev`, `task:fix`, `task:make-workflow`, `task:plan-close`, `task:review`.
- Fixed frontier commands: `task:design`, `task:plan-audit`, `task:plan-design`, `task:research`.
- Model selectors: economy=composer-2.5-fast, implementation=composer-2.5, frontier=claude-opus-5-thinking-high.
- Never replace fixed frontier or fixed implementation routes with `auto`.
